{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無印良品最近推出嘅神級零食「炸蝦頭」喺網上掀起洗版式熱議！呢款產自泰國、每包僅售HK$25嘅炸蝦頭，經特別油炸後質感極致酥脆，一開袋濃郁蝦香即刻撲鼻而來，超級香脆，絕對係下酒同睇劇嘅極品！</p><p>今次MUJI一口氣推出5款泰式地道風味，包括：蒜頭胡椒味、黑松露味、海鹽味、酸忌廉味和海苔味。鍾意鹹香酥脆小食嘅朋友，可以一試！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178827842237022898_14444989876a96f6974c005.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178827842481938778_2253917766a96f69a2e04c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178827842810740837_10045412806a96f69d4518d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178827843100493507_1881037246a96f69fa764d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T16:18:59.302998+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":226,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}